<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo-bkn.png"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css"/>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 15mm 20mm;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .no-print-bar {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
    }
    .btn-action {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #059669; color: #fff; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #e2e8f0; color: #334155; }

    .cert-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 3px double #065f46;
      padding: 44px 54px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      position: relative;
    }
    .cert-watermark {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      opacity: 0.05;
      width: 320px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .kop-surat {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 3px double #0f172a;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .kop-logo {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-right: 20px;
    }
    .kop-text {
      text-align: center;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .kop-text h2 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .kop-text h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #065f46;
      margin: 2px 0;
    }
    .kop-text p {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .doc-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .doc-title h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-decoration: underline;
      color: #065f46;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .doc-title p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-family: monospace;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .doc-content {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .data-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 14px 0 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .data-table td {
      padding: 6px 4px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .data-label {
      width: 220px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1e293b;
    }

    .status-lunas-banner {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      border: 2px solid #10b981;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .status-lunas-banner h4 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #047857;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .status-lunas-banner p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: #065f46;
    }

    .signature-grid {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 36px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .sig-col {
      width: 260px;
    }
    .sig-space {
      height: 60px;
    }
    .sig-seal {
      display: inline-block;
      border: 2px dashed #059669;
      color: #047857;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sig-name {
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
      .no-print-bar { display: none !important; }
      .cert-container { border: 2px solid #065f46; box-shadow: none; padding: 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="no-print-bar">
    <a href="<%= (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user && user.role === 'user') ? '/dashboard' : '/admin/pinjaman' %>" onclick="handleKembali(event, '<%= (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user && user.role === 'user') ? '/dashboard' : '/admin/pinjaman' %>')" class="btn-action btn-secondary" style="text-decoration: none;">
      <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali
    </a>
    <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-action btn-primary">
      <i class="bi bi-printer"></i> Cetak Surat Keterangan Lunas (SKL)
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="cert-container">
    <img src="/images/logo-bkn.png" alt="Watermark BKN" class="cert-watermark"/>

    <div class="kop-surat">
      <img src="/images/logo-bkn.png" alt="Logo BKN" class="kop-logo"/>
      <div class="kop-text">
        <h2>Badan Kepegawaian Negara &mdash; Kantor Regional V Jakarta</h2>
        <h1>Koperasi Pegawai Kanreg V BKN</h1>
        <p>Jl. Raya Ciracas No. 36, Ciracas, Jakarta Timur 13740 &bull; Telp: (021) 87721079 &bull; Email: koperasi@kanreg5bkn.id</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-title">
      <h3>Surat Keterangan Lunas (SKL)</h3>
      <p>Nomor: SKL-KOP/<%= String(pinjaman.id).padStart(5, '0') %>/<%= new Date().getFullYear() %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-content">
      Pengurus Koperasi Pegawai Badan Kepegawaian Negara Kantor Regional V Jakarta dengan ini menerangkan secara resmi bahwa:
    </div>

    <table class="data-table">
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Nama Pegawai</td>
        <td width="15">:</td>
        <td><strong><%= pinjaman.nama %></strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">NIP</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><code><%= pinjaman.nip %></code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Unit Kerja</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><%= pinjaman.unit_kerja || 'Kantor Regional V BKN Jakarta' %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Nomor Pembiayaan</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><strong>#PJ-<%= String(pinjaman.id).padStart(5, '0') %></strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Plafon Pinjaman Pokok</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><strong>Rp <%= Number(pinjaman.nominal_pengajuan).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>,-</strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Jangka Waktu / Tenor</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><%= pinjaman.tenor_bulan %> Bulan</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="data-label">Tanggal Pelunasan</td>
        <td>:</td>
        <td><strong><%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID', {weekday:'long', day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric'}) %></strong></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="status-lunas-banner">
      <h4><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill"></i> Dinyatakan Telah Lunas Sepenuhnya</h4>
      <p>Segala kewajiban angsuran pokok dan jasa pinjaman telah diselesaikan dengan baik tanpa ada tunggakan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-content">
      Surat Keterangan Lunas ini diterbitkan sebagai bukti otentik yang sah untuk dipergunakan sebagaimana mestinya, termasuk pembebasan potongan gaji bulanan (payroll) terkait pinjaman tersebut dan pengembalian hak anggota untuk mengajukan pembiayaan baru di masa mendatang.
    </div>

    <div class="signature-grid">
      <div class="sig-col">
        <!-- Kosong atau barcode QR -->
        <p style="font-size:11px; color:#64748b; margin-top:20px;">
          Dokumen ini diterbitkan secara elektronik oleh Sistem Informasi Koperasi Pegawai BKN Kanreg V Jakarta.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sig-col">
        <p>Jakarta, <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID', {day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric'}) %></p>
        <p>Pengurus Koperasi Pegawai Kanreg V BKN,</p>
        <div class="sig-space"></div>
        <div class="sig-seal">
          <i class="bi bi-shield-fill-check"></i> Tanda Tangan Elektronik
        </div>
        <p class="sig-name">Ketua / Bendahara Koperasi</p>
        <p style="font-size:11px;color:#64748b;">Koperasi Pegawai Kanreg V BKN Jakarta</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    function handleKembali(e, fallbackUrl) {
      if (window.opener && window.history.length <= 1) {
        window.close();
        setTimeout(function() { window.location.href = fallbackUrl; }, 150);
        return;
      }
      if (window.history.length > 1 && document.referrer && document.referrer.includes(window.location.host)) {
        e.preventDefault();
        window.history.back();
        return;
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
